      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 668594494,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It can be tedious to check the output (over all of the dissectors), but if you run:\n\n./tools/check_typed_item_calls.py --consecutive --file epan/dissectors/packet-woww.c\n\nyou get:\n\nExamining:\nepan/dissectors/packet-woww.c \n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-woww.c: - filter \"woww.movement.flags\" appears consecutively - labels are \"Movement Flags\" and \"Swim Pitch\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-woww.c:4745 ptvcursor_add called for hf_woww_character_race  -  item type is FT_UINT8 but call has len 4\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-woww.c:4746 ptvcursor_add called for hf_woww_character_gender  -  item type is FT_UINT8 but call has len 4\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-woww.c:4747 ptvcursor_add called for hf_woww_character_class  -  item type is FT_UINT8 but call has len 4\n\n3 warnings",
